## ⚙️ Installation Guide

### 🔹 Install P1 Dependencies (YOLOv8)

```bash
pip install -r P1requirements.txt
```

### 🔹 Install P2 Dependencies (DeepFace)

```bash
pip install -r P2requirements.txt
```

⚠️ **Note:**

* P1 uses **PyTorch (YOLOv8)**
* P2 uses **TensorFlow (DeepFace)**

Both are handled automatically via requirements files.

